web/node_modules/jsdom/README.md:Although we enjoy adding new features to jsdom and keeping it up to date with the latest web specs, it has many missing APIs. Please feel free to file an issue for anything missing, but we're a small and busy team, so a pull request might work even better.
web/node_modules/jsdom/README.md:Some features of jsdom are provided by our dependencies. Notable documentation in that regard includes the list of [supported CSS selectors](https://github.com/dperini/nwsapi/wiki/CSS-supported-selectors) for our CSS selector engine, [`nwsapi`](https://github.com/dperini/nwsapi).
